    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: any forests or grasslands.\n\nBrightroot is a low, broad-leafed plant whose chalk-white taproot divides into dozens of fine, luminous fibres. Herbalists prize specimens dug at sunrise, when their sharp scent is strongest, and dry the roots in narrow twists that resemble lengths of pale cord. When chewed, the fibres release a clean, peppery oil that clears the senses and steadies the hands. For 1 hour, you gain a +2-item bonus to Medicine checks.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
